,"type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_9","text":"but some of them either don't understand, or want to know more about what's going on.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_10","text":"I'm unsure as to how much I should tell them, or how to go about it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_11","text":"Could you help?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_12","text":"Ah, so that's it!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_13","text":"I'm a little busy right now,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_14","text":"but I can certainly help you out.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_15","text":"Thank you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_16","text":"I'll invite them into the group.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_17","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_17","text":"Rapi has invited Sugar to join the group.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_18","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_18","text":"Rapi has invited Laplace to join the group.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_19","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_19","text":"Wait, you were talking about these two?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_20","text":"Thanks for the invite,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_21","text":"Rapi.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_22","text":"Hey!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_23","text":"Did someone call for a hero?!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_24","text":"Uh...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_25","text":"Hello there.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_26","text":"I heard that you required an explanation for what's going on. Is that correct?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_27","text":"Yeah.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_28","text":"What's all this about how we should stop selling our coffee?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_29","text":"What's the big idea about saying our coffee tastes bad?!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_30","text":"This is all completely unprovoked! It doesn't make any sense.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_31","text":"There's clearly some kind of plot meant to undermine our cafe!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_32","text":"Oh, hehe... that's not what's happening.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_33","text":"Perhaps the fault lies with the Splendamin,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_34","text":"but much of the food being recently made in this area tastes quite strange.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_35","text":"Your coffee, I'm afraid, is no exception.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_36","text":"Therefore, I think it would be best not to sell it for a while.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_37","text":"All the food tastes weird?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_38","text":"So it's not just our coffee?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_39","text":"Correct.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_40","text":"Sugar, where are you, exactly?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_41","text":"Have no fear, the Hero is here to help you save your beloved flavor!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_42","text":"No kidding...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_43","text":"Then Black Typhoon's fuel might be compromised too.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_44","text":"I better go check.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_45","text":"See you guys later.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_46","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_46","text":"Sugar left the group chat.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_47","text":"Huh?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_48","text":"This is a catastrophe!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_49","text":"Black Typhoon's fuel going bad?!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_50","text":"This calls for some heroic intervention!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_51","text":"Hero, away!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_52","text":"alqk2","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_53","text":"Whoops, wrong button.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_54","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_54","text":"Laplace left the group chat.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_01_55","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_01_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newfla